","title":"Bhajan-gīti"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":58,"first_line":"śrī-kṛṣṇa-chaitanya prabhu jīve dayā kori’","author":"Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"},"title":["Auspicious Invocation","to Śaraṇāgati"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["śrī-kṛṣṇa-chaitanya prabhu jīve dayā kori’","svapārṣada svīya dhāma saha avatari"],"translation":["Lord Śrī Krishna Chaitanya,\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Being gracious upon the *jīva*-souls,\\","Along with Your associates and abode\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;You descended to this world"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["atyanta durlabha prema koribāre dāna","śikhāya saraṇāgati bhakatera prāṇa"],"translation":["To distribute freely\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;the love divine most rare;\\","By teaching exclusive surrender,\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;the life and soul of the devotee"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["dainya, ātmanivedana, goptṛtve varaṇa","‘avaśya rakṣibe kṛṣṇa’—viśvāsa pālana"],"translation":["Humility, self-giving,\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Embracing His guardianship,\\","‘Krishna will certainly protect me’ —\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Maintaining this faith."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["bhakti-anukūla mātra kārjera svīkāra","bhakti-pratikūla bhāva—varjanāṅgīkāra"],"translation":["Acceptance of all activities\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;favourable to devotion;\\","Embracing rejection of\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;adversity to devotion."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["ṣaḍ-aṅga śaraṇāgati hoibe jā̐hāra","tā̐hāra prārthanā śune śrī-nandakumāra"],"translation":["Those who surrender in this sixfold way —\\","Their prayer will be heard\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;by the divine son of Nanda."],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["rūpa-sanātana-pade dante tṛṇa kori’","bhakativinoda poḍe dui pada dhori’"],"translation":["Taking in his mouth a straw, falling\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;at the lotus feet of Śrī Rūpa-Sanātan;\\","Śrī Bhakti Vinod clasps their holy lotus feet."],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["kā̐diyā kā̐diyā bole, āmi to’ adhama","śikhāye śaraṇāgati karahe uttama"],"translation":["Weeping, weeping, I implore thee,\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;‘O I am afallen!\\","Please teach me to surrender,\\","&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;teach me pure devotion.’"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/01-sri-krishna-chaitanya","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/sri-krishna-chaitanya-prabhu-1","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":null},"head":{"canonical":"/en-2022/shri-krishna-chaitanya-prabhu-jive-daya-kori/","description":"Auspicious Invocation to Śaraṇāgati — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Auspicious Invocation to Śaraṇāgati. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en-2022","slug":"shri-krishna-chaitanya-prabhu-jive-daya-kori"}}